# Declarative WiFi networks for hello-sbc, most-preferred first (or set an
# explicit `priority` — higher wins). Referenced from BUILD.bazel via the
# sbc_application `wifi_config_file` arg; converted to JSON at build time and
# baked into the image.
#
# Copy this to `wifi.yaml` (gitignored) and fill in real credentials. The real
# file is never committed — passphrases would otherwise land in the world-readable
# image/store *and* in git history. For real secret hygiene use NetworkManager's
# environmentFiles instead of a plaintext PSK here.
- ssid: YOUR_SSID
  psk: YOUR_PSK
  priority: 100
- ssid: YOUR_FALLBACK_SSID
  psk: YOUR_FALLBACK_PSK
  priority: 10
